{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2c441e2128d71f79","name":"Aing-Tii Monk Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-2c441e2128d71f79","title":"Aing-Tii Monk Talent Tree","revision":15776,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:10Z","sha256":"a16f4b0396e2a3f9ea0edeabf5684c25a37e4f210479c68c5eb75703420e2da2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15776","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Aing-Tii%20Monk%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2c441e2128d71f79","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi  Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Aing-Tii Monks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Aing-Tii_Monks","referenceId":"reference:415da283ca25f058"}," have an understanding of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," that is different from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and most other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Traditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Traditions","referenceId":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," has many more aspects than just a Light Side and a Dark Side, and it is most useful for facilitating freedom of travel. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Aing-Tii Monks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Aing-Tii_Monks","referenceId":"reference:415da283ca25f058"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Aura of Freedom"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["All allies within 6 squares of you gain a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," checks made to escape ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapples"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapples"}," or other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilizing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilizing"}," Hazards. Additionally, whenever an ally within 6 squares of you is moved against its will (such as by the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Move Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Object","referenceId":"reference:1874cf1336711517"}]}," Force Power or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bantha Rush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bantha_Rush","referenceId":"reference:538eb665ec0bd30c"}," feat), you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to negate the forced movement entirely.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Folded Space Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fold Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fold_Space","referenceId":"reference:32f629fa5c321529"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you can use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fold Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fold_Space","referenceId":"reference:32f629fa5c321529"}]}," Force Power to move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," across long distances. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check to activate the Force Power is sufficient to move an object the same size as your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," (or larger), you can use the Force Power to move your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," and all of its occupants safely to the desired destination.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check result instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check, as though performing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Astrogation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Astrogation"},". This otherwise uses the normal rules for hyperspace travel, though travel is instantaneous and requires no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Liberate"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Aura of Freedom"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to designate one ally within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," that is currently ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilized"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilized"},"; that target automatically escapes from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," (or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilization"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilization"}," effect is removed), and the target can move up to half its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," immediately as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Many Shades of the Force"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] or [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Light Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Side"}]},"] descriptor in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". That ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is no longer considered to have that descriptor for you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Spatial Integrity"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["While you are aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," taking damage; you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and reduce the damage the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes by the check result. This reduction occurs after both DR and SR are applied to the damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
